---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Servicios | Código Ágil">
	<div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 reveal">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#687284] mb-4 tracking-tight">Ingeniería y Seguridad</h1>
		<p class="text-xl text-[#687284] opacity-80 leading-relaxed">Nuestro catálogo de servicios está diseñado para proteger y escalar tu negocio en un entorno digital hostil.</p>
	</div>

	<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
		<div class="bg-[#E8F8EE] p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 border border-[#D8DEE6] group reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
			<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#FFFFFF] text-[#69BC83] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-[#69BC83] group-hover:text-[#FFFFFF] transition-colors duration-300 shadow-sm">
				<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"></path></svg>
			</div>
			<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#687284] mb-3 tracking-tight">Desarrollo a Medida</h2>
			<p class="text-[#687284] leading-relaxed">Sistemas web, aplicaciones móviles y APIs robustas construidas con las últimas tecnologías para resolver las necesidades únicas de tu operación.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="bg-[#E8F8EE] p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 border border-[#D8DEE6] group reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
			<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#FFFFFF] text-[#69BC83] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-[#69BC83] group-hover:text-[#FFFFFF] transition-colors duration-300 shadow-sm">
				<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg>
			</div>
			<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#687284] mb-3 tracking-tight">Auditoría y Pentesting</h2>
			<p class="text-[#687284] leading-relaxed">Simulamos ataques reales para identificar vulnerabilidades en tus sistemas antes de que sean explotadas por agentes maliciosos.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="bg-[#E8F8EE] p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 border border-[#D8DEE6] group reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.3s;">
			<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#FFFFFF] text-[#69BC83] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-[#69BC83] group-hover:text-[#FFFFFF] transition-colors duration-300 shadow-sm">
				<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"></path></svg>
			</div>
			<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#687284] mb-3 tracking-tight">Arquitectura Cloud</h2>
			<p class="text-[#687284] leading-relaxed">Migración, gestión y fortificación de servidores en la nube (AWS, Azure, GCP) asegurando alta disponibilidad y redundancia de datos.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>